1
00:00:30,199 --> 00:00:35,160
Earth, I'm not letting you go.

2
00:00:35,160 --> 00:00:37,213
I'm worried about you.

3
00:00:37,213 --> 00:00:39,266
What are you talking about?

4
00:00:41,320 --> 00:00:44,213
I said I'm worried about you.
Clear enough?

5
00:00:46,276 --> 00:00:49,886
Are you worried about me, or are you just
finding an excuse to mess with me?

6
00:00:52,101 --> 00:00:55,640
Can't I worry about you?
I didn't mean it like that.

7
00:00:57,717 --> 00:00:58,939
Then what did you mean?

8
00:01:01,644 --> 00:01:02,510
I…

9
00:01:04,389 --> 00:01:07,685
I've been overthinking, Earth.
You said you had some damn study session—

10
00:01:07,960 --> 00:01:12,749
—what the hell was that?

11
00:01:13,880 --> 00:01:17,962
I never thought you'd dare lie to me.

12
00:01:17,962 --> 00:01:20,514
But lately… it's not adding up.

13
00:01:21,828 --> 00:01:27,916
I didn't want to ask. I waited for you
to tell me yourself. But you didn't tell me anything.

14
00:01:29,016 --> 00:01:33,508
I've been stressed, man.
I even had to go talk to Night about it.

15
00:01:36,680 --> 00:01:39,794
Shit… I've never been like this before.

16
00:01:40,650 --> 00:01:42,516
Why the hell do I have to
worry about you this much?
